      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arles-ear-p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "游戏把艺术家最著名的身体意象之一转化成真正的空间入口：角色割下耳朵并将它置于房间中的容器后，原本属于身体的一部分变成可以进入的通道。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "The game turns one of the artist's most famous bodily motifs into a literal spatial entrance: after the character removes his ear and places it in a vessel, part of the body becomes a passage that can be entered."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "major",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-arles-game"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arles-ear-p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "耳内并不是写实结构，而是一段不断延伸的超现实走廊。门、物件与尺度关系被重新排列，卧室的逻辑开始彻底失效。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Inside the ear is not a realistic anatomy but an extended surreal corridor. Doors, objects, and scale are rearranged, and the logic of the bedroom stops behaving normally."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "major",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-arles-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arles-ear-p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "从这一刻开始，“逃出房间”已经不再是唯一目标。更重要的是穿过艺术家自身的内部世界，再回到一个看似相同、实际已经改变的房间。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "From this point, escaping the room is no longer the only goal. The more important movement is through the artist's internal world and back into a room that looks familiar but has changed."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "major",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-arles-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
